"2113458757850026135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧠 Unresponsive ICU patients just raised &amp; lowered a beeping tone with their THOUGHTS. Columbia's noninvasive EEG brain-computer interface gave ~1 in 3 a first voice. Full story 👇 https://t.co/8KfWy6lMkW #BCI #AINews https://t.co/Ey2lNeafCH", "url": "https://x.com/SeriouslyItsAi/status/2113458757850026135"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113716834260201472"]}, "author_id": "823799206267625473", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:45:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113718476993179956"], "id": "2113718476993179956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 543, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Smoothing the path to clinical revenue.\n\nRoadmap 1 of Protocol Labs’ BCI Roadmap Series examines the reimbursement, regulatory, and go-to-market steps needed to bring brain-computer interface devices to patients and build a path to clinical revenue.\n\n👉 https://t.co/ncTYVIsELQ https://t.co/6UTedpCe1z", "url": "https://x.com/protocollabs/status/2113718476993179956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113526050173145088", "3_2113526055294443520"]}, "author_id": "1344144345209864193", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:00:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113526074609205306"], "id": "2113526074609205306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Wuhan, a city shaped by the rivers, is now riding the wave of cutting-edge technology. \nBrain-Computer Interface (BCI) is no longer confined to sci-fi films or complex labs. Today, with just a lightweight, non-invasive headband, people in Wuhan can connect their brain signals to https://t.co/ybmYYr7fkU", "url": "https://x.com/discover_wuhan/status/2113526074609205306"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113471122155122688"]}, "author_id": "766879493474574337", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:24:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113471674108780560"], "id": "2113471674108780560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On October 22, a team from Columbia University published a paper in Brain, using a non-invasive brain-computer interface (BCI) to give silent ICU patients a \"voice\" through thought. In the study, 41 patients with acute brain injury successfully controlled the frequency of a https://t.co/QcjdcQvfqA", "url": "https://x.com/bukanche/status/2113471674108780560"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113293215600119809"]}, "author_id": "1265792121249820675", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:36:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113293303265317225"], "id": "2113293303265317225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 205, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Coherence Neuro raised a $45 million Series A round co-led by Founders Fund and the OpenAI Startup Fund to develop cancer therapies that continuously learn and improve. The company is building neurotechnology and brain-computer interface (BCI) platforms designed to monitor cancer https://t.co/jpetLMFP4g", "url": "https://x.com/TradedVC/status/2113293303265317225"}, {"author_id": "2007674042422374400", "created_at": "2026-10-22T05:10:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113135983046922595"], "id": "2113135983046922595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Peter Thiel이 공동창업한 Founders Fund가 OpenAI Startup Fund와 함께 뇌종양 치료 스타트업 Coherence Neuro의 $45M 투자 라운드에 참여했다.\n\n흥미로운 건 이 회사가 단순 AI 신약개발사가 아니라는 점이다.\n\nCoherence Neuro는 뇌종양 주변의 전기신호를 직접 측정하는 신경 임플란트를 개발하고", "url": "https://x.com/Bren_Jeong/status/2113135983046922595"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112475849190703104", "3_2112475849211699200"]}, "author_id": "1307266399060942849", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:27:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113306134283166111"], "id": "2113306134283166111", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 121, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Neural signal recording is an important part of brain–computer interfaces. SENSINGX, incubated from a Hainan University research team, develops chips for neural recording and modulation. Its 128-channel product has received a national brain–computer interface innovation award, https://t.co/sq04JJ50vn", "url": "https://x.com/HainanToday/status/2113306134283166111"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113421024859410432"]}, "author_id": "1929347167451516928", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:03:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113421065586364556"], "id": "2113421065586364556", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Neuralink,  Paradromics, And Synchron Brain-Computer Interface Technology https://t.co/qSkaEsw89H", "url": "https://x.com/jerrysmith89658/status/2113421065586364556"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113723448560091136"]}, "author_id": "1768688830666735616", "created_at": "2026-10-23T20:05:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113723547159806287"], "id": "2113723547159806287", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Going on half a century of brain computer interface https://t.co/4MB6kKmX4H", "url": "https://x.com/TheUnjournaling/status/2113723547159806287"}, {"author_id": "18557134", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:00:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113601440061304960"], "id": "2113601440061304960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 